 ("What is the official website to check a Chinese company?", "The National Enterprise Credit Information Publicity System at gsxt.gov.cn, run under China's State Administration for Market Regulation. It is free but only in Chinese."),
 ("What is a Unified Social Credit Code?", "It is the 18-character code printed on every Chinese business licence that identifies the company. Search it on the official registry and check the returned name matches the licence."),
